1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,566
if you know many English words
如果你认识很多英语单词

2
00:00:04,366 --> 00:00:07,900
but you still freeze when you open your mouth
但一开口还是会卡住

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,966
then this lesson is for you
那这节课就是为你准备的

4
00:00:15,466 --> 00:00:16,566
hello everyone
大家好

5
00:00:18,266 --> 00:00:22,266
welcome back to the slow English podcast
欢迎回到慢速英语播客

6
00:00:26,266 --> 00:00:27,566
take a deep breath
深呼吸

7
00:00:29,933 --> 00:00:37,500
stretch your shoulders and relax today
舒展一下肩膀，今天放轻松

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,466
let's make your English speak naturally
让你的英语说得更自然

9
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:50,300
today we talk about how to stop translating before you speak
今天我们聊聊，怎样在开口前不再翻译

10
00:00:53,066 --> 00:00:54,666
many students tell me
很多学生跟我说

11
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:58,500
i want to say something in English
我想用英语说点什么

12
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:06,533
but first i make a sentence in Chinese in my head
但我会先在脑子里组织一句中文

13
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:12,000
then i try to translate every word
然后试着逐字翻译

14
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,966
it takes too long
这太花时间了

15
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,133
and i get nervous
我就会紧张

16
00:01:22,333 --> 00:01:23,566
why does this happen
为什么会这样？

17
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:29,733
because you are treating English like a math puzzle
因为你把英语当成了一道数学题

18
00:01:31,533 --> 00:01:33,666
not a living language
而不是一门活的语言

19
00:01:37,366 --> 00:01:42,600
we need to train your brain to react directly to real life
我们要训练大脑，直接对真实生活做出反应

20
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:46,533
let's try an example
我们来试一个例子

21
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,533
when you feel cold
当你觉得冷的时候

22
00:01:52,466 --> 00:01:55,800
don't search for the Chinese word in your head
不要在脑子里搜索中文词

23
00:01:58,666 --> 00:02:00,266
close your eyes for a moment
闭上眼睛一会儿

24
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:07,800
imagine stepping outside on a dark winter afternoon
想象在一个昏暗的冬日午后走出门

25
00:02:11,266 --> 00:02:16,766
the wind touches your face you shiver
风吹过你的脸，你打了个寒颤

26
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:23,933
you hug yourself and pull your coat tight
你抱紧自己，裹紧外套

27
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,566
that cold feeling in your body
身体里那种冷的感觉

28
00:02:31,566 --> 00:02:33,566
that is the word freezing
就是 freezing 这个词

29
00:02:36,133 --> 00:02:38,533
you don't need a Chinese word in between
中间不需要任何中文

30
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:43,866
you feel it and you say
你感受到它，然后说

31
00:02:45,333 --> 00:02:46,666
i'm freezing
I'm freezing

32
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:54,200
let's try another one delicious
再试一个：delicious

33
00:02:57,166 --> 00:02:59,700
don't translate it to Chinese
不要把它翻译成中文

34
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:06,900
imagine taking a bite of your favorite chocolate cake
想象咬一口你最爱的巧克力蛋糕

35
00:03:09,700 --> 00:03:16,500
it is soft rich and sweet
柔软、浓郁又香甜

36
00:03:19,066 --> 00:03:20,933
ha you smile
哈，你笑了

37
00:03:23,266 --> 00:03:25,600
that pleasure in your mouth
嘴里那种美妙的享受

38
00:03:27,533 --> 00:03:29,300
that is delicious
这就是 delicious

39
00:03:32,133 --> 00:03:37,533
connect the English word directly to your physical experience
把英语单词直接和身体的感受连起来

40
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,400
how can you practice this every day
每天怎么练习呢？

41
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:49,600
start with action verbs in your daily life
从日常生活中的动作动词开始

42
00:03:52,366 --> 00:03:54,266
when you pick up your water glass
当你拿起水杯

43
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:59,400
say in your mind drink
在心里说 drink

44
00:04:02,066 --> 00:04:03,866
when you sit down on your chair
当你坐到椅子上

45
00:04:05,733 --> 00:04:08,066
say sit
就说 sit

46
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:13,333
when you see a cute dog in the park
当你在公园看到一只可爱的小狗

47
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:20,666
feel happy and say cute
感受那份开心，说 cute

48
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:25,200
one word at a time
一次一个词

49
00:04:27,566 --> 00:04:34,933
build a bridge between the real world and English now
在真实世界和英语之间搭起一座桥。现在

50
00:04:36,566 --> 00:04:38,366
let's do a short test together
我们一起做个小测试

51
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:43,366
i will say one sentence
我会说一句话

52
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:48,133
don't translate it into Chinese
不要翻译成中文

53
00:04:49,966 --> 00:04:52,200
just picture the scene in your mind
只要在脑海里想象那个画面

54
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:59,200
warm rain falls softly on the green grass
温暖的雨轻轻落在绿草上

55
00:05:03,133 --> 00:05:04,533
did you see the rain
你看到雨了吗？

56
00:05:06,766 --> 00:05:08,533
did you feel the warmth
你感受到温暖了吗？

57
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,700
did you see the green grass
你看到绿草了吗？

58
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:16,900
hmm wonderful
嗯，太棒了

59
00:05:19,066 --> 00:05:21,966
that is thinking in English
这就是用英语思考

60
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:27,600
learning a language is not about speed
学语言不在于快

61
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:33,533
it is about connecting with reality
而在于和真实世界建立联系

62
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:39,100
be gentle with yourself
对自己温柔一点

63
00:05:40,966 --> 00:05:43,733
take small steps every day
每天进步一点点

64
00:05:46,266 --> 00:05:48,666
if you enjoyed this lesson
如果你喜欢这节课

65
00:05:50,333 --> 00:05:53,533
please like and follow this channel
请点赞并关注这个频道

66
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:58,866
write one thing you saw in your head
把刚才测试中你脑海里看到的一样东西

67
00:05:59,333 --> 00:06:02,566
during our test in the comments below
写在下方评论区

68
00:06:05,466 --> 00:06:09,166
keep calm stay patient
保持平静，保持耐心

69
00:06:11,066 --> 00:06:12,666
and see you next time
我们下次见
